; Fresh ACE ED chassis startup.  This file is installed only in the
; disposable System: copy made by tools/amiga-ed-fresh-run.
; Keep the boot small and deterministic: the real AmigaOS 3.1 ED binary still
; comes from the Amiga Forever System: volume.  Workbench is not needed for
; this CLI-driven probe.

C:MakeDir RAM:T RAM:ENV
Assign T: RAM:T
Assign ENV: RAM:ENV
Assign Work: EXISTS
Path C: SYS:System SYS:Utilities S:

C:Execute Work:ed-probe/boot-run

EndCLI >NIL:
